tion-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"><strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">FIND TIRES:</strong> We’ll help you find and compare tires based on your vehicle or tire size.</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"><strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">SCHEDULE INSTALLATION:</strong> Choose a local installer from our list of trusted professionals.</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"><strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">BUY:</strong> There are no hidden fees. You’ll see all of your charges before you buy.</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"><strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">HEAD TO THE INSTALLER</strong>:&nbsp;The tires will be waiting there, where they’ll be installed for you.</li></ol><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Let us answer any of your questions before you check out so that you can feel confident with your purchase.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="xl:mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-xl sm:mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-xl  mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-xl component !mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-sm sm:!mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-sm lg:!mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-sm"><div class="analytics-event-listener contents"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 w-full component [&amp;.component_&amp;]:p-0 h-full mx-auto max-w-screen-xxl px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16"><div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-8 md:col-start-3"><div class="w-full max-w-[var(--breakpoint-container-max-width)] mx-auto" data-qa-id="AccordionContainer"><div class="mb-6"><h2 class="subtitle-xl text-type-standard">General Tire Questions</h2></div><div class="w-full" role="presentation" data-qa-id="accordion-container-"><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0" id="accordion-header-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:when-should-i-buy-new-tires&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="-when-should-i-buy-new-tires"> When Should I Buy New Tires?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_7_--when-should-i-buy-new-tires?-0" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">For the most enjoyable driving experience it's important to replace worn tires. Optimum traction helps provide responsive handling for a smooth, reliable ride.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">To determine when you should start shopping, follow these simple steps:</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"><strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">1. GRAB A PENNY:&nbsp;</strong> First, test the tread. Pinch a penny between your thumb and forefinger, so that the top of Lincoln's head is showing.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">2. <strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">TEST TIRE TREAD:&nbsp;</strong> Place the top of Lincoln's head into one of the tire tread grooves - try to measure in the deepest point within the tread.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">3. <strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold">WHAT DOES LINCOLN'S HEAD SHOW?:&nbsp;</strong> If any part of Lincoln's head is obscured by the tread, your tires have enough tread.&nbsp;However, if you can see above the head, you're ready for a new tire.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">4.<strong class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !font-bold"> ADDITIONAL TESTS:&nbsp;</strong> You should always check your tires in several tread locations.&nbsp;Be sure to check the inner, outer, and middle grooves of each tire, as tires can wear differently on each side, due to improper wheel alignment and/or low inflation.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">For professional help, visit a&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="-us/shops/index.html" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:rich-text:inline-link-p2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;index.html" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0 inline-link-p2">Goodyear store</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;for a free inspection by our tire professionals.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1" id="accordion-header-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:choosing-a-new-tire-what-should-i-consider&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="-choosing-a-new-tire-what-should-i-consider"> Choosing a New Tire: What Should I Consider?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_7_--choosing-a-new-tire:-what-should-i-consider?-1" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><ul class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 !normal-case mb-2"><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Look for tires that excel in tests for braking, handling.</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Let treadwear, ride comfort, noise, and rolling resistance help narrow your choices. (Goodyear's comparative tread-life tests demonstrate that a manufacturer's warranty doesn't always reflect how a tire will wear, but used as an estimate, it's an important piece of information)</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case">Choosing a vehicle tire depends on where you live, weather and terrain issues, what performance expectations you have, and what your vehicle requires.</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_7_--will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work?-2"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_7_--will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work?-2" id="accordion-header-_r_7_--will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work?-2" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_7_--will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work?-2" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="-will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work"> Will the Tires Arrive at My Home or Work?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_7_--will-the-tires-arrive-at-my-home-or-work?-2-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span cl