an><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_7_--how-do-i-add-road-hazard-protection?-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_7_--how-do-i-add-road-hazard-protection?-7" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_7_--how-do-i-add-road-hazard-protection?-7" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">If you’d like to add road hazard protection to your purchase, you can talk to your installer about what they offer for purchase during your appointment.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8" id="accordion-header-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-many-tires-will-i-need&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="-how-many-tires-will-i-need"> How Many Tires Will I Need?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_7_--how-many-tires-will-i-need?-8" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">We recommend installing four new tires, especially if you’re purchasing winter tires or tires for all-wheel drive vehicles. To help avoid premature treadwear and get the most out of your tires, replace all four tires at once and maintain a healthy rotation schedule (recommended every 6,000 miles).</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">If you do decide to buy just two new tires and they are the same size and construction of the tires already on your vehicle, you should install the new tires on the rear axle. Please note that you should never mix radial and bias-ply tires on the same axle. If you’re using radial tires with bias or bias-belted tires on the same vehicle, always place the radial tire on the rear axle. You should never mix tires with different speed ratings.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">You can call us at&nbsp;<a href="tel:800-667-8138" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:rich-text:inline-link-p2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;exit&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;tel:800-667-8138&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|rich-text&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0 inline-link-p2">800-667-8138</a> if you have any questions about which tires are best for your situation.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_7_--how-does-the-goodyear-online-ordering-checkout-process-work?-9"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_7_--how-does-the-goodyear-online-ordering-checkout-process-work?-9" id="accordion-header-_r_7_--how-does-the-goodyear-online-ordering-checkout-process-work?-9" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-