xt-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Termed End-of-life tires, 90% of these are recycled for energy recovery in the U.S., Europe, and Japan.&nbsp;<a href="-us/shops/index.html" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:rich-text:inline-link-p2&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;URL&quot;:&quot;index.html" class="relative cursor-pointer sm:inline-block font-type-cta custom-focus !normal-case sm:after:block after:transform-origin-center inline-block link-md text-action-text-link-primary after:content-[&quot;&quot;] after:block after:h-0.5 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out after:origin-center after:scale-x-100 hover:after:scale-x-0 inline-link-p2">Goodyear Tire &amp; Service Network locations</a>&nbsp;will handle the disposal of your tires for a small fee that they use to ship the tires in bulk to third party entities. The tires are then burned to power cement kilns or are ground into asphalt.<sup class="paragraph-xs text-action-color-secondary">1</sup></p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"><sup class="paragraph-xs text-action-color-secondary">1</sup>&nbsp;<sub class="paragraph-xs text-action-color-secondary">Goodyear 2010 Corporate Responsibility Report</sub></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="xl:mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-xl sm:mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-xl  mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-xl component !mb-mobile-spacing-margin-bottom-lg sm:!mb-tablet-spacing-margin-bottom-lg lg:!mb-desktop-spacing-margin-bottom-lg"><div class="analytics-event-listener contents"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 w-full component [&amp;.component_&amp;]:p-0 bg-background-base max-w-screen-xxl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16" data-qa-id="GridContainer"><div class="col-span-12"><div class="max-w-[